1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:04,400
The final of the Shizuoka Regional Tournament has finally begun.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,840
Right after the match started,

3
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:09,030
Otomo's quartet immediately stole the ball.

4
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:13,990
They passed it to Nitta, but Tsubasa stood in his way.

5
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:18,530
We witnessed a clash of the aces right after kick-off!

6
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:22,500
The one who emerged victorious from that small duel was Tsubasa.

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,920
His attack was then stopped by Otomo's quartet.

8
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:31,380
As you know, Nankatsu could lose this match.

9
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:36,000
Nagasaki representative Hiroshi Jito and Katagiri from the Japan National Football Federation

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,480
foresaw the possibility of Nankatsu losing.

11
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:43,560
Nitta tried to prove them right with his Hawk Shot.

12
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:47,310
Take this! Hawk Shot!

13
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:56,180
The shot didn't become a goal, but

14
00:00:56,180 --> 00:01:00,870
Tsubasa felt the power of that shot firsthand.

15
00:01:00,870 --> 00:01:04,710
Uncontrolled Running Volley!

16
00:01:07,780 --> 00:01:11,960
Tsubasa scored a magnificent goal!

17
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:14,050
The first half ended 1-0,

18
00:01:14,050 --> 00:01:17,310
and the second half looks like it's going to be thrilling!

19
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,180
Locker Room
NANKATSU Middle School - Waiting Room

20
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:21,360
Alright, everyone did a great job.

21
00:01:22,180 --> 00:01:23,980
Coach, what's this?

22
00:01:23,980 --> 00:01:27,370
Lemon slices dipped in honey from our manager.

23
00:01:27,370 --> 00:01:30,510
Oh, right! Bless her hands.

24
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:33,400
Keep it up exactly like this in the second half.

25
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:35,030
Alright, Coach!

26
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:39,200
Sorry, I couldn't save that last shot.

27
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:42,490
It wasn't your fault.

28
00:01:42,490 --> 00:01:45,330
Tsubasa is truly a player far above the rest.

29
00:01:45,330 --> 00:01:48,790
Damn it! I couldn't even score one goal.

30
00:01:48,790 --> 00:01:51,040
Calm down, Nitta.

31
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:54,050
They'll come at us just like they did in the first half.

32
00:01:54,050 --> 00:01:56,050
And we'll keep doing the same thing.

33
00:01:56,050 --> 00:02:00,090
We defend, you score. That's what Otomo is all about.

34
00:02:00,090 --> 00:02:02,060
This is our one and only best option.

35
00:02:02,060 --> 00:02:04,220
We're counting on you, Nitta.

36
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:05,500
Yes.

37
00:02:06,390 --> 00:02:09,390
But I realized in the first half

38
00:02:09,390 --> 00:02:13,020
that I can't beat Tsubasa one-on-one.

39
00:02:13,610 --> 00:02:15,780
Then what can I do?

40
00:02:17,620 --> 00:02:18,740
If only...

