80
00:03:57,420 --> 00:04:01,760
Episode 31:
HAWK VS TSUBASA

81
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:03,160
The anticipated second half begins.

82
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:04,300
There's no other way.

83
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:05,130
Let's go!

84
00:04:05,130 --> 00:04:08,060
They're pushing hard because we fell back!

85
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:09,990
Play tough and stay mobile!

86
00:04:09,990 --> 00:04:10,770
Yes!

87
00:04:10,770 --> 00:04:12,310
There's no other way!

88
00:04:12,310 --> 00:04:16,040
Will Otomo Middle School find a goal in this half?

89
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:20,070
Nitta runs towards the goal.

90
00:04:20,070 --> 00:04:22,860
But this strategy hasn't worked so far.

91
00:04:22,860 --> 00:04:24,610
I won't allow it, Nitta.

92
00:04:24,610 --> 00:04:28,240
Nankatsu's ace, Tsubasa, is personally marking Nitta.

93
00:04:29,420 --> 00:04:30,750
Damn you, Tsubasa!

94
00:04:30,750 --> 00:04:34,370
But no matter what, we'll pass to Nitta!

95
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:39,170
I can shake off his marking with my speed.

96
00:04:41,020 --> 00:04:44,090
But if I control the ball, I can't shoot...

97
00:04:52,010 --> 00:04:55,980
What?! Did Nitta shoot without controlling the ball?

98
00:04:55,980 --> 00:05:00,940
But due to his bad timing, the ball went out.

99
00:05:00,940 --> 00:05:01,690
Nitta!

100
00:05:01,690 --> 00:05:02,820
Nitta!

101
00:05:02,820 --> 00:05:06,200
Hey, hey! You can only dream of doing what Tsubasa does!

102
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:09,280
You need way more experience to pull off that shot.

103
00:05:10,650 --> 00:05:15,280
I know. I know it better than any of you.

104
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:20,920
But this is the only way to score against Nankatsu.

105
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:27,010
What's with him? He's attempting a high-level shot he hasn't even practiced.

106
00:05:27,010 --> 00:05:28,200
I don't know.

107
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:30,930
But no matter what, we have to pass to him.

108
00:05:30,930 --> 00:05:32,580
There's nothing else we can do!

109
00:05:34,930 --> 00:05:38,520
Nankatsu's Taki continues the match with a throw-in.

110
00:05:40,460 --> 00:05:41,940
Iwami!

111
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,110
Got it!

112
00:05:44,110 --> 00:05:44,820
Nishio!

113
00:05:44,820 --> 00:05:47,660
A quick steal from Otomo...

114
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:50,580
The Otomo players have become quite ambitious.

115
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:51,320
Alright!

116
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:53,950
Nitta accelerates to break free from the marking!

117
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:54,910
Nitta!

118
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:58,920
Nitta and the Otomo quartet are perfectly in sync!

119
00:06:03,340 --> 00:06:06,970
Nitta shoots again without controlling the ball!

120
00:06:06,970 --> 00:06:08,600
But it goes wildly off target again.

121
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,220
It must be tough for him.

122
00:06:10,940 --> 00:06:15,640
Despite Nitta's talent, shooting without controlling the ball

123
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:17,890
is beyond a middle school student's level.

124
00:06:17,890 --> 00:06:19,720
Nitta.

125
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,900
This kid...

126
00:06:20,900 --> 00:06:22,610
Now the outcome of the match has become uncertain!

127
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:24,860
Why?

128
00:06:25,300 --> 00:06:29,470
The timing of the last shot was better than the previous one.

129
00:06:29,490 --> 00:06:32,780
There's still a chance before the match ends...

130
00:06:32,780 --> 00:06:34,780
There's no other way

131
00:06:34,780 --> 00:06:36,970
to capitalize on that long pass in front of you...

132
00:06:36,970 --> 00:06:40,280
I have to perfect the Uncontrolled Running Volley Hawk Shot.

133
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:44,050
There's no other way!

134
00:06:44,820 --> 00:06:47,920
Otomo intercepts another pass!

135
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:50,760
And they sent a long ball to Nitta!

136
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:55,100
Marked by Tsubasa... Nitta uses his speed to break free from the marking.

137
00:06:55,100 --> 00:06:56,680
The main issue is timing!

138
00:06:57,810 --> 00:06:59,280
This time it will work..!

139
00:07:02,550 --> 00:07:04,320
He shot the ball without any hesitation!

140
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,930
Ah, man! It just grazed past!

141
00:07:09,930 --> 00:07:13,030
On his 3rd attempt, he finally took a proper shot,

142
00:07:13,030 --> 00:07:14,490
shocking everyone!

143
00:07:14,490 --> 00:07:16,850
I'm not wrong!

144
00:07:16,850 --> 00:07:21,500
Nitta's timing is getting better and better.

145
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:24,500
If it continues like this, it could be a disaster for us.

146
00:07:24,500 --> 00:07:27,510
What are you, Shun Nitta?

147
00:07:27,510 --> 00:07:31,220
In a short time and in the middle of the match,

148
00:07:31,220 --> 00:07:34,390
you're mastering a new shot.

149
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,970
It's a bit raw, but

150
00:07:35,970 --> 00:07:40,020
he has an incredible talent for football.

151
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:46,770
Thanks to Otomo's quartet, Nankatsu's forward line has completely collapsed.

152
00:07:46,770 --> 00:07:50,440
Since Tsubasa has to mark Nitta on defense,

153
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:54,700
he hasn't been able to do anything so far.

154
00:07:54,700 --> 00:07:57,450
Nankatsu is ahead, but

155
00:07:57,450 --> 00:07:59,750
Otomo isn't letting the ball out of Nankatsu's half.

156
00:08:00,220 --> 00:08:05,750
If Nitta can somehow make that shot,

157
00:08:05,750 --> 00:08:08,840
Nankatsu's dream of winning will be shattered.

158
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:11,960
I really don't like Nitta.

159
00:08:13,260 --> 00:08:15,760
Calm down, Kumi.

160
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:18,640
What do you mean "calm down"?

161
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:20,660
He keeps getting past Tsubasa's marking,

162
00:08:20,660 --> 00:08:22,140
and it's driving me crazy!

163
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:24,600
Don't you think so too, Sanae?

164
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,870
Well, it's just a match.

165
00:08:26,870 --> 00:08:29,750
Sanae, you're too relaxed.

166
00:08:29,750 --> 00:08:35,570
Tsubasa and the others will handle it.

167
00:08:37,490 --> 00:08:39,820
Isn't Nankatsu a bit too passionate?

168
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:41,930
Y-Yes...

169
00:08:41,930 --> 00:08:44,670
I'm not jealous or anything, you know.

170
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:49,830
But even though Otomo has crushed Nankatsu's forward line,

171
00:08:49,830 --> 00:08:52,460
Nitta's situation as a forward isn't looking great either.

172
00:08:52,460 --> 00:08:56,180
If someone had joined Nitta up front so far,

173
00:08:56,180 --> 00:08:58,280
they would have scored at least three goals.

174
00:08:58,280 --> 00:09:02,060
Surprisingly, what the teams need right now is just strength.

175
00:09:02,060 --> 00:09:10,020
Yes, team strength, like that of Toho Academy.

176
00:09:10,620 --> 00:09:12,970
That's why, even though Nankatsu has Tsubasa,

177
00:09:12,970 --> 00:09:17,740
We will be the champions of this traditional tournament.

178
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,160
What?

179
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:25,640
Captain Tsubasa, who has been marking Nitta until now,

180
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:27,830
is moving to attack for the first time in this half!

181
00:09:27,830 --> 00:09:32,580
There was no other way to stop the consecutive passes to Nitta.

182
00:09:32,580 --> 00:09:35,970
Besides, we need one more goal to feel comfortable.

183
00:09:36,530 --> 00:09:37,300
He's here!

184
00:09:37,300 --> 00:09:38,300
Tsubasa!

185
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:42,180
He's passed the midfield!

186
00:09:42,180 --> 00:09:44,080
Run, Tsubasa!

187
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:46,310
This is the Nankatsu we're used to!

188
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,440
Take this!

189
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:50,150
Instead of advancing, Tsubasa

190
00:09:50,150 --> 00:09:51,650
sent the ball to the right!

191
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:53,820
The ball is with Taki!

192
00:09:57,420 --> 00:09:58,070
Taki!

193
00:09:58,070 --> 00:10:02,790
This incredible passing traffic feels very familiar!

194
00:10:02,790 --> 00:10:05,120
You never know what else could happen.

195
00:10:05,610 --> 00:10:06,410
What?!

196
00:10:06,410 --> 00:10:08,170
Well done, Taki!

197
00:10:08,170 --> 00:10:11,050
Instead of advancing on the wing, Taki

198
00:10:11,050 --> 00:10:12,500
is heading straight for the goal!

199
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:15,260
I'm counting on you, Kisugi!

200
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,680
Alright! Got it!

201
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:20,180
One-on-one with the goalkeeper!

202
00:10:20,180 --> 00:10:21,050
Come on!

203
00:10:21,050 --> 00:10:22,680
Kisugi shoots!

204
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:29,650
He saved it! A magnificent save from the goalkeeper!

205
00:10:29,650 --> 00:10:31,400
Nice save, Ichijo!

206
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:35,690
Nankatsu's first attempt of the second half ended in failure!

207
00:10:36,330 --> 00:10:37,150
Catch it!

208
00:10:38,380 --> 00:10:41,160
Damn it! We made a good attack, but...

209
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:43,140
When Tsubasa joins the attack,

210
00:10:43,140 --> 00:10:46,160
a passing rhythm forms among the players.

211
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:51,080
But Otomo is making a quick counter-attack!

212
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,880
It's yours, Nitta!

213
00:10:55,190 --> 00:10:57,010
Get the timing right this time!

214
00:10:57,790 --> 00:11:01,100
Timing! Timing!

215
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:06,100
The timing seems right!

216
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:06,720
This is not good!

217
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:14,690
Oh no! It hit his hand!

218
00:11:15,780 --> 00:11:18,760
Nankatsu's defender Oda handled the ball!

219
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:20,570
Come on, man.

220
00:11:20,570 --> 00:11:22,240
This is a chance!

221
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:25,490
Nitta got the timing about 80% right.

222
00:11:26,130 --> 00:11:27,800
But the ball spun to the right,

223
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:30,750
and hit Oda's arm!

224
00:11:30,750 --> 00:11:32,830
Huge danger for Nankatsu!

225
00:11:32,830 --> 00:11:35,920
A free kick is a big chance for a goal!

226
00:11:36,350 --> 00:11:40,930
Alright! With no one marking me, I can use the Hawk Shot!

227
00:11:41,450 --> 00:11:44,970
Nitta... He'll definitely shoot directly at the goal.

228
00:11:47,180 --> 00:11:49,080
Don't leave wide gaps between you!

229
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:52,740
Everyone get close, don't let anything pass through you!

230
00:11:52,740 --> 00:11:53,350
Yes!

231
00:11:55,460 --> 00:11:57,680
The wall will block this side.

232
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:59,530
Morisaki guards the left side,

233
00:11:59,530 --> 00:12:01,990
and I'll guard the right side.

234
00:12:01,990 --> 00:12:06,120
Tsubasa, instead of shooting, Nitta might pass.

235
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:09,540
No, I'm sure he'll take his chance.

236
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:12,000
I believe in you, Nitta.

237
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:13,620
Yes.

238
00:12:13,620 --> 00:12:18,910
Will Otomo rely on Nitta's shot,

239
00:12:18,910 --> 00:12:21,470
or do they have a different plan?

240
00:12:23,090 --> 00:12:24,080
Let's go!

241
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:26,350
Oh! Urabe is running towards the ball!

242
00:12:26,350 --> 00:12:27,180
What?

243
00:12:27,180 --> 00:12:28,200
Nitta!

244
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,140
He didn't shoot!

245
00:12:29,140 --> 00:12:31,480
As expected, Nitta is taking the shot!

246
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:35,150
Eat this! Hawk Shot!

247
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:42,140
You can send your feedback on the subtitles to our Instagram account.
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

248
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:46,450
Eat this!

249
00:12:48,660 --> 00:12:51,040
Falcon Shot!

250
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:56,670
Nitta hits it straight!

251
00:12:57,330 --> 00:12:58,460
We blocked it!

252
00:12:58,460 --> 00:12:59,670
That's it!

253
00:12:59,670 --> 00:13:02,880
But the shot opened a gap in Nankatsu's wall!

254
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:04,930
Damn it! Was that what he was planning?!

255
00:13:04,930 --> 00:13:05,860
You did it!

256
00:13:05,860 --> 00:13:07,430
Go, Nitta!

257
00:13:08,430 --> 00:13:09,770
I did it!

258
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:12,060
I won't let you score!

259
00:13:12,060 --> 00:13:12,810
Go!

260
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,190
This move...!

261
00:13:15,890 --> 00:13:17,730
This is the second Hawk Shot!

262
00:13:19,710 --> 00:13:21,700
Tsubasa saved it with a diving header!

263
00:13:21,700 --> 00:13:22,720
Tsubasa!

264
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:23,570
What?!

265
00:13:23,570 --> 00:13:25,810
Otomo Middle School still hasn't found the goal!

266
00:13:25,810 --> 00:13:27,950
That was Wakashimazu's move!

267
00:13:33,380 --> 00:13:35,250
Great save, Tsubasa!

268
00:13:35,250 --> 00:13:38,000
Your defensive skills are incredible, Tsubasa Ozora.

269
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,220
Amazing!

270
00:13:39,220 --> 00:13:41,750
Tsubasa is so cool.

271
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:44,040
No way...

272
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:46,760
My Hawk Shot...

273
00:13:46,760 --> 00:13:49,160
The shot was perfect.

274
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:50,550
How did he save it?

275
00:13:50,550 --> 00:13:51,820
Alright.

276
00:13:51,820 --> 00:13:53,640
Otomo's morale is broken.

277
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:54,730
The rest is up to you, Izawa!

278
00:13:54,730 --> 00:13:56,140
Get the ball!

279
00:13:56,140 --> 00:13:56,980
Got it!

280
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,600
Oh crap! Fall back!

281
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:01,730
Tsubasa is heading to attack without wasting any time!

282
00:14:01,730 --> 00:14:05,400
Nakao! Hiraoka! Don't let Nankatsu get the ball!

283
00:14:06,050 --> 00:14:09,160
I won't lose the aerial ball!

284
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:10,390
Tsubasa!

285
00:14:10,390 --> 00:14:12,410
Izawa succeeds!

286
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:14,410
Very nice, Izawa!

287
00:14:14,410 --> 00:14:16,910
Tsubasa moves to attack with Izawa's pass!

288
00:14:16,910 --> 00:14:18,430
Alright! Let's do this!

289
00:14:18,430 --> 00:14:20,430
They're imitating Otomo's playing style!

290
00:14:20,430 --> 00:14:22,710
This time it's Nankatsu's turn to counter-attack!

291
00:14:22,710 --> 00:14:24,380
Fall back, guys, hurry!

292
00:14:24,380 --> 00:14:26,100
Run, Tsubasa!

293
00:14:26,100 --> 00:14:28,630
Keep running!

294
00:14:28,630 --> 00:14:30,890
If we accept conceding a second goal and fall 2 goals behind,

295
00:14:30,890 --> 00:14:32,890
we'll have no chance of winning!

296
00:14:32,890 --> 00:14:35,810
But if I steal the ball from Tsubasa now,

297
00:14:35,810 --> 00:14:37,380
there's no one marking Nitta...!

298
00:14:37,380 --> 00:14:40,900
I can turn this crisis into an advantage!

299
00:14:40,900 --> 00:14:42,190
Urabe...

300
00:14:42,190 --> 00:14:44,610
You have to take the ball from Tsubasa!

301
00:14:44,610 --> 00:14:45,440
Yes!

302
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:47,590
Tsubasa is attacking quite fast.

303
00:14:47,590 --> 00:14:51,030
Only Otomo's quartet can keep up with this speed!

304
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:53,030
This time, for sure...

305
00:14:53,030 --> 00:14:54,830
Tsubasa...

306
00:14:54,830 --> 00:14:56,330
I will pass!

307
00:14:56,330 --> 00:14:58,330
We'll stop him! I'm going first!

308
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:02,290
Tsubasa passed the defense with a little chip!

309
00:15:02,290 --> 00:15:03,170
What?!

310
00:15:03,170 --> 00:15:06,340
He passed Kishida, who was closest to him!

311
00:15:06,340 --> 00:15:07,560
You won't go any further!

312
00:15:07,560 --> 00:15:08,970
I'm next!

313
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:12,430
He skillfully passes the second defender too!

314
00:15:12,430 --> 00:15:13,720
Tsubasa...!

315
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:16,220
Will he be able to pass the third opponent as well?

316
00:15:16,220 --> 00:15:17,680
As if I'll allow it!

317
00:15:19,270 --> 00:15:20,270
What?!

318
00:15:20,270 --> 00:15:21,770
He passed the third one too!

319
00:15:21,770 --> 00:15:25,860
He quickly bounced the ball under his opponent to pass him!

320
00:15:25,860 --> 00:15:29,740
Wow, Tsubasa, you really show your worth in a situation like this.

321
00:15:29,740 --> 00:15:31,070
Just one more...

322
00:15:31,070 --> 00:15:34,950
Urabe challenges Tsubasa!

323
00:15:34,950 --> 00:15:36,030
Captain!

324
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:40,580
A nice slide from Urabe!

325
00:15:40,580 --> 00:15:42,040
They reached the ball at the same time!

326
00:15:42,490 --> 00:15:46,040
The ball went up in the air!

327
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:46,800
Alright!

328
00:15:47,340 --> 00:15:49,800
Tsubasa runs towards where the ball fell!

329
00:15:52,340 --> 00:15:52,960
Damn it!

330
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:54,390
We'll definitely stop him!

331
00:15:54,510 --> 00:15:56,640
We can't let him shoot!

332
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:59,020
A goal would be our end!

333
00:16:00,430 --> 00:16:02,600
A final effort from Otomo's quartet!

334
00:16:02,600 --> 00:16:05,080
However, Tsubasa's shot was faster than them!

335
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:08,230
He made it by just 1 second!

336
00:16:08,230 --> 00:16:09,110
Ichijo!

337
00:16:09,110 --> 00:16:10,240
It's all up to you!

338
00:16:12,760 --> 00:16:13,770
He saved it!

339
00:16:13,770 --> 00:16:15,950
A perfect jump from Ichijo!

340
00:16:16,830 --> 00:16:17,840
He did it!

341
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:18,950
You're amazing, Ichijo!

342
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:21,290
They barely saved it, didn't they?

343
00:16:21,540 --> 00:16:24,700
When Otomo's quartet went to stop Tsubasa,

344
00:16:24,700 --> 00:16:28,050
Tsubasa only had a 1-second advantage.

345
00:16:28,300 --> 00:16:31,840
This way, they were able to weaken Tsubasa's shot.

346
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:34,590
That was the ferocity of Otomo Middle School, you see.

347
00:16:34,590 --> 00:16:39,600
Otomo Middle School used its full defensive strength to stop Tsubasa's attack!

348
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:41,300
Ah, come on...

349
00:16:41,300 --> 00:16:43,320
It was unlucky, wasn't it, Sanae?

350
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:45,320
We still have plenty of time.

351
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:48,270
I know, that's true, and we're ahead as well.

352
00:16:48,270 --> 00:16:50,280
But we must not lower our guard!

353
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:52,900
You never know how it will end.

354
00:16:52,900 --> 00:16:54,410
Come on, Ichijo!

355
00:16:54,410 --> 00:16:55,700
This is our chance!

356
00:16:55,700 --> 00:16:56,490
Okay!

357
00:16:57,910 --> 00:16:58,950
No way!

358
00:16:58,950 --> 00:17:01,520
Ichijo throws the ball to Urabe.

359
00:17:04,700 --> 00:17:05,460
Nitta!

360
00:17:06,710 --> 00:17:08,690
He then passes it to the open Nitta!

361
00:17:08,690 --> 00:17:10,900
The danger they experienced turned into a huge chance!

362
00:17:10,900 --> 00:17:13,010
They are sure Nitta will score this.

363
00:17:13,010 --> 00:17:15,590
Tsubasa won't be able to mark him this time!

364
00:17:15,590 --> 00:17:16,350
We did it!

365
00:17:16,350 --> 00:17:17,660
We'll finally score!

366
00:17:17,660 --> 00:17:18,720
It's all up to you, Nitta!

367
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:20,600
You have time to control the ball.

368
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:23,640
Ichijo...

369
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:25,530
and everyone..

370
00:17:25,530 --> 00:17:28,530
I'm grateful you stopped that last attack...

371
00:17:28,530 --> 00:17:32,470
However, even if I'm unmarked, I'll shoot without letting the ball touch the ground.

372
00:17:32,470 --> 00:17:34,490
I'll score directly!

373
00:17:38,130 --> 00:17:39,240
Nitta!

374
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:40,270
Nitta!

375
00:17:40,990 --> 00:17:41,740
Go!

376
00:17:41,740 --> 00:17:45,580
This is my Uncontrolled Running Volley Hawk Shot for you!

377
00:17:48,780 --> 00:17:51,030
The ball is in the net! Goal!

378
00:17:51,030 --> 00:17:52,300
The match is tied!

379
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:57,240
Goalkeeper Morisaki and Nankatsu's defense were frozen!

380
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:58,970
U-Unbelievable...

381
00:17:59,900 --> 00:18:01,370
He did it this time...

382
00:18:01,370 --> 00:18:03,790
What do we do? It's tied.

383
00:18:09,580 --> 00:18:11,960
I did it...

384
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:13,130
I did it!

385
00:18:13,130 --> 00:18:14,940
I finally pulled off the move!

386
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:18,070
My Uncontrolled Running Hawk Shot!

387
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:19,820
Wow, you bastard...

388
00:18:19,820 --> 00:18:21,580
He finally did it!

389
00:18:21,580 --> 00:18:26,830
In the first 10 minutes of the second half, Otomo Middle School has finally tied it 1-1.

390
00:18:26,830 --> 00:18:28,920
Go, Otomo, Go!

391
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:30,720
You were amazing, Nitta!

392
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:32,140
We'll take the lead like this!

393
00:18:32,140 --> 00:18:36,760
Now even Tsubasa's marking can't stop you.

394
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:38,400
Keep scoring, Nitta!

395
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:41,540
Otomo Middle School's ambition to beat Nankatsu has grown even more.

396
00:18:41,540 --> 00:18:44,390
The match is getting more and more interesting!

397
00:18:44,390 --> 00:18:47,500
Nitta... What kind of kid are you..!

398
00:18:47,500 --> 00:18:48,940
Damn it!

399
00:18:48,940 --> 00:18:51,310
I haven't lost yet.

400
00:18:51,310 --> 00:18:53,600
He's right! The match is just starting now!

401
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:56,320
Don't act like you've already won, Otomo!

402
00:18:56,320 --> 00:18:59,300
Yes! We're aiming for our third championship!

403
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:01,490
As if we'll lose!

404
00:19:01,490 --> 00:19:03,620
Tsubasa, let's beat them!

405
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:05,830
Guys...

406
00:19:05,830 --> 00:19:09,540
Okay! If you concede, you score right back! That's the basic principle of football!

407
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:10,660
Let's go, guys!

408
00:19:10,660 --> 00:19:11,960
Yes!

409
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:14,180
Nankatsu won't accept defeat, right?

410
00:19:14,180 --> 00:19:18,260
Of course they won't. They're just getting started, aren't they, Sanae?

411
00:19:18,260 --> 00:19:19,470
Yes.

412
00:19:19,470 --> 00:19:22,320
The match is tied. What will you do, Tsubasa?

413
00:19:22,320 --> 00:19:24,720
Will you keep marking Nitta?

414
00:19:24,720 --> 00:19:25,970
Or...

415
00:19:25,970 --> 00:19:27,680
If you concede, you score right back!

416
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:30,980
Nitta, this time we'll score the goal against you!

417
00:19:30,980 --> 00:19:34,230
Don't let your spirits down, boys.

418
00:19:34,230 --> 00:19:38,240
Nankatsu is preparing for a counter-attack!

419
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:39,520
Let's go, Kisugi!

420
00:19:39,520 --> 00:19:40,490
Yes!

421
00:19:44,990 --> 00:19:46,500
We're attacking, guys!

422
00:19:46,500 --> 00:19:48,330
We'll take the lead again.

423
00:19:48,330 --> 00:19:49,120
Yes.

424
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:53,710
Let's go! The best defense is a good offense!

425
00:19:53,710 --> 00:19:56,320
If Tsubasa comes to attack, as soon as the ball comes to us,

426
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:58,740
pass it quickly to Nitta.

427
00:19:58,740 --> 00:19:59,710
Yes!

428
00:19:59,710 --> 00:20:00,800
Let's go, Izawa!

429
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:01,800
Kisugi!

430
00:20:01,800 --> 00:20:02,800
Taki!

431
00:20:02,800 --> 00:20:06,010
We're forming a good forward line in the second half.

432
00:20:06,010 --> 00:20:10,060
This time, we'll break through the Otomo quartet.

433
00:20:10,060 --> 00:20:12,680
As expected, since Tsubasa joined the attack,

434
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:18,150
Izawa, Kisugi, and Taki have started moving freely.

435
00:20:18,150 --> 00:20:21,400
Damn it! We were getting the ball easily up until now.

436
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:24,030
Great! Otomo's defense is collapsing!

437
00:20:24,030 --> 00:20:26,220
We'll target the goal directly!

438
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:29,840
Yes, we'll do that... Release the ball!

439
00:20:30,540 --> 00:20:31,250
What?!

440
00:20:31,250 --> 00:20:34,200
After passing the opponent's defensive line,

441
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:37,250
Nankatsu passes the ball back to Tsubasa again!

442
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:42,670
Tsubasa sends a pass towards the goal.

443
00:20:42,670 --> 00:20:45,430
And he keeps running after making the pass!

444
00:20:45,430 --> 00:20:47,180
He passed and ran!

445
00:20:48,100 --> 00:20:52,020
Kisugi heads the ball down right in front of Tsubasa.

446
00:20:52,540 --> 00:20:53,520
No way!

447
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:55,230
I'm going to score!

448
00:20:55,230 --> 00:21:00,030
Even though I'm a midfielder, I'm Nankatsu's playmaker.

449
00:21:00,030 --> 00:21:02,560
I'm also the ace forward!

450
00:21:02,560 --> 00:21:06,530
A real forward converts every chance into a goal!

451
00:21:06,530 --> 00:21:09,030
Come on, Tsubasa!

452
00:21:14,980 --> 00:21:16,440
Goal!

453
00:21:16,440 --> 00:21:18,810
An incredible shot from Tsubasa!

454
00:21:18,810 --> 00:21:21,960
This time, it was a blow to Ichijo as well.

455
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:23,020
I did it!

456
00:21:23,020 --> 00:21:25,470
Nankatsu takes the lead again with this goal!

457
00:21:25,470 --> 00:21:28,220
Yes! He did it, he did it, he did it!

458
00:21:28,220 --> 00:21:30,130
You're amazing!

459
00:21:31,600 --> 00:21:33,020
Sanae...

460
00:21:36,760 --> 00:21:39,650
I can't break my old habit.

461
00:21:39,650 --> 00:21:42,900
You're amazing, Tsubasa, amazing!

462
00:21:43,330 --> 00:21:48,010
Otomo Middle School shouldn't have let Tsubasa shoot!

463
00:21:48,010 --> 00:21:53,330
When Tsubasa moved to middle school, he changed his position.

464
00:21:53,330 --> 00:21:56,500
In elementary school, he was a central forward.

465
00:21:56,500 --> 00:21:58,640
Even though the number of his shots has decreased,

466
00:21:58,640 --> 00:22:00,780
he's still in top form.

467
00:22:00,780 --> 00:22:07,510
Statistically, 87% of his shots have resulted in goals in the three years since he first entered the tournament!

468
00:22:07,510 --> 00:22:09,600
Guys, don't let your guard down.

469
00:22:09,600 --> 00:22:12,640
This was an important goal, but we're only one goal ahead.

470
00:22:12,640 --> 00:22:14,320
We have to keep protecting this!

471
00:22:14,320 --> 00:22:15,640
Yes!

